$$19^{156} \equiv 1 \pmod{157}$$

Now, $385 = 156 \times 2 + 73$, so:
$$19^{385} \equiv 19^{73} \pmod{157}$$

## Step 4: Compute $19^{73} \pmod{157}$ using binary exponentiation

